<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
<p>Dear Aymen,</p>

<p>A new cancellation request for Opportunity has been submitted to Sales Admin. Please find below the details of Request.</p>

<table>
	
		<tr>
			<td style=""><strong>Opportunity</strong>:-</td>
			<td>{{{Opportunity.Name}}}</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style=""><strong>Project</strong>:-</td>
			<td>{{{Opportunity.Project_Name__c}}}</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style=""><strong>Tower</strong>:-</td>
			<td>{{{Opportunity.Building__c}}}</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td><strong>Unit</strong>:-</td>
			<td>{{{Opportunity.Unit_Title__c}}}</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td><strong>Requester</strong>:-</td>
			<td>{{{Sender.FirstName}}}&nbsp;{{{Sender.LastName}}}</td>
		</tr>
	
</table>
</body>
</html>